{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Do not let an earlier nonfatal error mask a later JVM fatal.** If an inner hook throws `AssertionError` and a subsequently unwound hook throws `OutOfMemoryError` or `ThreadDeath`, this retains the assertion and discards the fatal entirely. Continue running all hooks, but track VM-fatal/`ThreadDeath` failures separately and rethrow them in preference to nonfatal errors; add a nonfatal-first, fatal-later regression.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77INSr","finding_digest":"f34a07c18c86d58528d4a6e51574b8a871ca9ca058043067641ec4a328ffa41a","finding_id":"arf_v1_6nfapqmmq3kykkguu3srk5fyvb","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::later-fatal-precedence","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::later-fatal-precedence","line":115,"observation_digest":"9a46c3d30d2e1f70c65d1ec268b31d64e5e9ac91545b5333b451cd0ba3edd77e","observation_id":"aro_v1_tjdmhuynfypxbrs5d3bgrmy5mt","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-07T23:58:43Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ahpygitvijm2xuf5p2wjqxp4wv","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"dceb158abc6b47b3cbbdc07b99e5d70e670f4826","reviewer":"codex","start_line":115,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_3t44asieg7j764cfvuh3shtg4d","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T23:58:43Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
